{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Powerful Special Skills by Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/unit_special_attack_640.gif?t=1747741160\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Robots have unique special skills that excel in emergency situations and when facing large numbers of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Weapons for Each Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/main_unit_list.gif?t=1747741160\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each robot can utilize three main weapons, with two skill trees available for each main weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the formations of sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Through Leveling Up</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/level_up_640.gif?t=1747741160\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By defeating enemies in stages, you gain experience points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reaching certain experience thresholds allows you to level up and choose skill cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Various Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/boss_list_640.gif?t=1747741160\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against unique bosses across a total of 10 stages, each with their own distinct characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tense Boss Battles and Diverse Attack Patterns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/boss_attack_type_640.gif?t=1747741160\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two bosses are the same, and most will randomly use one of three special attack patterns, providing enjoyment even in repeated playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Elements - Robots and Main Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/upgrade_unit_640.gif?t=1747741160\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your robot\u2019s stats and traits using in-game currency gained from gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also unlock and enhance weapon skills to see changes in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Elements - Sub Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/extras/upgrade_sub_weapon_640.gif?t=1747741160\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each sub weapon comes with two skill trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen and level up your sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Defeat Boss Gobellinus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/b63639eb8ffb1a95932f7a5ce0d48060d3239737.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Boss Kobold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/6dea1b8bf5e7adec22f735272a1190027b1e3b0d.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Boss Gremlin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/ae65c3ecb6e8c2bcc10ee35c17f5bce307bdcb67.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Boss Lavalion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/8d33dcace277fa6ed4c250095217744723424baf.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Boss Melusine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/e8ea5fafc7b02c5e66c37f6e71aa7739567e4dfd.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Boss Merrow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/5921655e8462f9e840803de643df3108ebc21995.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Boss Brontes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/42ea52611286e18be19aaad855e90ae77df3eccd.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Boss Steropes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/a2e89946bac1084ad5f2c816286f643c52dbaab0.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Boss Arges","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/578acd19915025c378a684669be9239cfcac8376.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Boss Banshee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092280/9c70bb52790e72a65022043a74b6f113cb9ed0b4.jpg"}],"total":45},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3092280?t=1747741160","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3092280?t=1747741160","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/75c8c71dd8dcca73a006bc0202fceccdae929b40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747741160","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092280/75c8c71dd8dcca73a006bc0202fceccdae929b40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747741160","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_de